---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';

const effectiveDate = 'October 9, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy and cookie policy for seanmelotti.com — what data this site does (and mostly doesn't) collect."
>
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Legal"
    title="Privacy & Cookie Policy"
    lede={`Effective ${effectiveDate}. The short version: this site sets no cookies, runs no analytics and collects no personal data unless you choose to email me.`}
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-page">
      <div class="prose-page max-w-2xl">
        <h2>Who I am</h2>
        <p>
          This website, seanmelotti.com, is the personal portfolio of Sean Melotti
          (&ldquo;I&rdquo;, &ldquo;me&rdquo;). It showcases restoration, fabrication and
          additive manufacturing work. For anything related to this policy, contact me at
          <a href="mailto:seancmelotti@gmail.com">seancmelotti@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>What this site does not do</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>No analytics or visitor tracking of any kind.</li>
          <li>No cookies set in your browser.</li>
          <li>No advertising, ad networks or retargeting.</li>
          <li>No contact forms, accounts or sign-ups — so no data is submitted through the site.</li>
          <li>No third-party fonts or embeds that phone home. All fonts are served from this site&rsquo;s own domain.</li>
          <li>No selling, renting or sharing of personal information — I have none to sell.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>What is processed, and why</h2>
        <h3>Server and network logs</h3>
        <p>
          This site is delivered through Cloudflare, the hosting and content delivery
          provider. Like virtually every host on the internet, Cloudflare automatically
          processes technical data when you load a page — your IP address, browser type,
          and the pages requested — to deliver the site, mitigate attacks and keep it
          secure. I do not use this data to identify visitors. The legal basis for this
          processing is legitimate interest in operating a functional, secure website.
          See the <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="noopener">Cloudflare
          Privacy Policy</a> for details on their handling of this data.
        </p>

        <h3>Email contact</h3>
        <p>
          If you choose to email or call me using the details on the
          <a href="/contact">contact page</a>, I will receive the information you send
          (such as your email address, name and message). I use it solely to respond to
          you and for any follow-up you ask for. I keep correspondence only as long as
          needed for that purpose, and you can ask me to delete it at any time.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          This site does not set cookies &mdash; first-party or third-party &mdash; and
          does not use local storage to track you. That is why there is no cookie consent
          banner: there is nothing to consent to.
        </p>

        <h2>External links</h2>
        <p>
          Pages on this site may link to external websites. Those sites have their own
          privacy practices, which I do not control and am not responsible for.
        </p>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          Depending on where you live (for example under the EU/UK GDPR or the California
          Consumer Privacy Act), you may have rights to access, correct, delete or restrict
          the use of personal data concerning you. Because this site collects nothing beyond
          what is described above, in practice this applies only to email correspondence
          you have sent me. To exercise any of these rights, email
          <a href="mailto:seancmelotti@gmail.com">seancmelotti@gmail.com</a> and I will
          respond promptly. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with your local
          data protection authority.
        </p>

        <h2>Children</h2>
        <p>
          This site is a professional portfolio and is not directed at children. I do not
          knowingly collect personal information from anyone under 16.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          If the site ever adds features that change how data is handled (such as analytics
          or a contact form), this policy will be updated before those features go live, and
          the effective date above will change accordingly.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
